WEBVTT

00:01.740 --> 00:05.230
Saints protect the people,

00:05.640 --> 00:10.990
and we protect those who protect us.

00:10.990 --> 00:12.990
Do you understand, Lawrence?

00:13.660 --> 00:19.240
Should you ever meet a saint, 
you mustn't forget that.

00:19.240 --> 00:23.160
After all, you're a bit 
different from the rest.

00:32.760 --> 00:34.640
Pastor!

00:37.520 --> 00:39.520
Oh, hello there.

00:39.520 --> 00:41.880
I'm sorry to bother you when you're busy.

00:41.880 --> 00:46.390
There's something that my boy wants
to talk to only the lady saint about.

00:47.270 --> 00:50.150
What's wrong to make you make such a face?

00:50.490 --> 00:51.810
It's quite all right.

00:51.810 --> 00:53.900
She doesn't have any appointments right now.

00:54.280 --> 00:56.900
The lady saint is inside.

00:56.900 --> 00:57.910
Lady Saint!

00:59.160 --> 01:00.080
Yes?

01:05.420 --> 01:07.770
Is there something you wished 
to speak with me about?

01:10.240 --> 01:14.250
So, that's how my friend and I
left things after we fought.

01:14.250 --> 01:16.800
It's gonna be hard to start 
seeing them again tomorrow.

01:16.800 --> 01:19.680
Lady Saint, what should I do?

01:19.960 --> 01:23.510
Well, what would make it less 
painful to see them again?

01:23.510 --> 01:24.390
What?

01:24.390 --> 01:25.600
Um...

01:25.600 --> 01:28.900
maybe to go back to how we 
were before the fight?

01:28.900 --> 01:32.850
Lady Saint! Can you use your 
powers to make time go backwards?

01:32.850 --> 01:34.300
No, I can't.

01:35.290 --> 01:40.410
All I can do is guide someone 
as they walk their path.

01:40.410 --> 01:44.410
If that someone doesn't gather 
up their courage and walk, well...

01:44.770 --> 01:48.530
And you already know what 
you should do, don't you?

01:48.530 --> 01:53.020
Don't worry. That's the right path.

01:53.020 --> 01:56.990
Was it disrespectful of us to come 
and ask the lady saint for advice?

01:56.990 --> 01:58.240
Not at all.

01:58.240 --> 02:02.040
The lady saint will hear 
any worries one might have.

02:02.300 --> 02:05.180
She accepts people's doubts and 
indecisions and lends a helping hand.

02:05.840 --> 02:08.480
That is the duty of a saint, after all.

03:40.280 --> 03:43.990
Episode 1

03:40.280 --> 03:43.990
The Relationship Between Them

03:45.670 --> 03:47.990
Excellent work, Lady Saint.

03:47.990 --> 03:49.490
But I was wondering...

03:49.490 --> 03:51.540
Droop...

03:51.540 --> 03:54.170
Don't you think there's too great a disparity

03:54.170 --> 03:56.470
between your previous demeanor 
and your current appearance?

03:56.470 --> 03:58.350
That doesn't matter, does it?

03:58.350 --> 04:00.870
After all, you're the only 
one here right now, Lawren.

04:00.870 --> 04:01.960
Really?

04:01.960 --> 04:03.840
Don't worry, Lawren.

04:03.840 --> 04:06.530
If anyone comes, 
I'll straighten up right away.

04:06.530 --> 04:08.520
That isn't really the issue I was—

04:08.520 --> 04:10.050
Pastor!

04:10.050 --> 04:13.290
I have something I'd like 
to give the lady saint!

04:11.190 --> 04:13.290
Oh, just a moment!

04:17.220 --> 04:22.040
Oh, Lady Saint! You always look so lovely.

04:20.160 --> 04:24.450
<i>For some reason, the lady saint acts lazy, 
but only in front of me.</i>

04:22.040 --> 04:24.440
You flatter me.

04:24.730 --> 04:27.050
Laze...

04:27.050 --> 04:30.460
As I asked before, Lady Saint, 
why do you do that?

04:30.460 --> 04:32.920
Because there's no one here anymore.

04:32.920 --> 04:35.330
And as I mentioned, 
that isn't the issue I was—

04:35.330 --> 04:37.460
Lady Saint!

04:40.480 --> 04:42.210
Hello, everyone!

04:43.610 --> 04:46.800
<i>Why does she only laze around 
like that in front of me?</i>

04:47.220 --> 04:52.290
Bye bye, Lady Saint! Pastor!

04:54.220 --> 04:56.030
Droop...

04:56.030 --> 04:57.730
Lady Saint!

04:58.970 --> 05:01.830
I think that's taking lazing 
around a little too far.

05:01.830 --> 05:02.960
Lazing around?

05:02.960 --> 05:03.780
Yes.

05:03.780 --> 05:07.060
Why do you laze around like that as soon 
as it's just me here with you?

05:07.060 --> 05:09.160
Um, that's because...

05:09.160 --> 05:13.360
You ask that, but you're the 
one who doesn't let me do anything.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.960
You won't let me dig with the hoe.

05:15.960 --> 05:18.600
Because you might fall and hurt yourself.

05:18.600 --> 05:20.800
And you won't let me cook either.

05:21.070 --> 05:23.800
Because you might burn yourself.

05:23.630 --> 05:24.880
Overprotective.

05:27.130 --> 05:28.160
Well then!

05:28.160 --> 05:31.270
I'm going to go on my rounds 
and visit all the homes.

05:31.270 --> 05:32.420
Lady Saint, you—

05:32.420 --> 05:33.180
I'll go, too!

05:33.180 --> 05:33.890
What?

05:33.890 --> 05:35.890
But you'll have to walk a ways.

05:35.890 --> 05:37.210
I will go.

05:37.210 --> 05:38.790
All right.

05:38.790 --> 05:41.790
But if they ask you to show them a miracle,

05:41.790 --> 05:43.860
please make sure 
to skillfully dodge the topic.

05:44.260 --> 05:48.920
Your mysterious powers aren't something 
that can be seen with the eyes, after all.

05:48.920 --> 05:50.360
I understand.

05:50.360 --> 05:52.370
Will you really be all right?

05:52.370 --> 05:54.040
How rude.

05:54.040 --> 05:56.600
In that case, I'll show you right here.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.620
Yes, please do.

05:58.620 --> 06:00.560
Here I have a deck of cards...

06:00.560 --> 06:01.880
You're staying here!

06:01.880 --> 06:03.670
I-I'll be fine!

06:03.670 --> 06:06.320
I promise I won't do anything weird!

06:06.320 --> 06:08.170
All right.

06:08.170 --> 06:10.320
Then, I'll go make 
the necessary preparations.

06:10.320 --> 06:11.480
All right!

06:13.460 --> 06:17.560
I-I'm going out with Lawren?

06:18.880 --> 06:20.580
I'm so happy!

06:20.580 --> 06:22.820
Oh, but before that...

06:22.820 --> 06:25.430
Angels of the church, gather here!

06:30.360 --> 06:31.930
You angels.

06:31.930 --> 06:34.830
You've been following Lawren 
around again, haven't you?

06:36.840 --> 06:39.760
I completely understand that 
he's comfortable to be around,

06:39.760 --> 06:42.330
but can't you please 
refrain just a little bit?

06:42.330 --> 06:45.720
Actually, I'm jealous, 
so please just stop doing that.

06:46.200 --> 06:47.890
Sorry to keep you waiting.

06:49.550 --> 06:51.210
Is something wrong?

06:51.210 --> 06:53.640
Oh, um, well...

06:53.640 --> 06:56.050
Come on, let's hurry on our way!

06:56.050 --> 06:57.150
Wait, please.

06:57.150 --> 06:59.220
If you hurry, you could trip and fall!

07:02.790 --> 07:04.740
You're in a very good mood.

07:05.990 --> 07:09.150
Pastor, Lady Saint, hello!

07:09.600 --> 07:10.920
Hello!

07:11.400 --> 07:12.690
<i>Really.</i>

07:12.690 --> 07:15.640
<i>Why is it only in front of me 
that she doesn't pretend like that?</i>

07:15.780 --> 07:17.040
<b>He's slow.</b>

07:17.720 --> 07:21.320
Then, if you have no objections, 
next week, we'll do the same thing.

07:21.320 --> 07:23.110
Oh, it's the lady saint!

07:23.110 --> 07:24.170
Lady Saint!

07:24.170 --> 07:26.550
Please show us a miracle!

07:26.970 --> 07:29.720
A miracle! A miracle!

07:29.720 --> 07:33.840
I know we're in the middle of a conversation, 
but if I could take a moment?

07:33.960 --> 07:37.070
I couldn't steer them away from the idea,

07:37.070 --> 07:39.600
so I exercised my right to stay silent.

07:39.600 --> 07:42.680
You really seemed to be 
at a loss back there.

07:43.340 --> 07:44.360
Well, I mean...

07:44.360 --> 07:48.860
Right now, we have to find a way 
to convince the children...

07:53.270 --> 07:55.600
Lady Saint, you're amazing!

07:55.600 --> 07:57.550
Oh, it worked.

07:58.820 --> 08:00.360
Oh, Lady Saint,

08:00.360 --> 08:02.660
I'd like to stop by there 
for a little while.

08:02.660 --> 08:04.350
Are you going to buy something?

08:04.350 --> 08:05.080
No.

08:05.080 --> 08:07.740
Since we're here, I thought 
I'd say hello to the shop owner.

08:07.740 --> 08:09.840
Would it be all right 
if I took a little time here?

08:09.840 --> 08:12.390
Yes, that would be fine.

08:13.470 --> 08:15.240
Stare...

08:17.980 --> 08:20.240
So sorry for scaring you!

08:20.240 --> 08:21.180
Hello.

08:21.180 --> 08:24.000
Pastor, it's been a long time 
since the last time you came by.

08:23.140 --> 08:25.280
<i>A clothing shop?</i>

08:24.010 --> 08:25.680
I'm sorry I can't stop by more often.

08:25.960 --> 08:28.650
Lady Saint, you should have 
a look around, if you'd like!

08:30.820 --> 08:34.690
In that case, I'll take you 
at your word and indulge myself.

08:34.690 --> 08:38.700
<i>She really is used to switching 
back and forth like that.</i>

08:39.120 --> 08:40.900
How is Eric doing?

08:39.960 --> 08:43.200
<i>She has all sorts of things here.</i>

08:40.900 --> 08:42.400
He's great!

08:42.400 --> 08:43.840
That's wonderful to hear.

08:48.600 --> 08:51.540
It-It's so incredibly lovely!

08:51.540 --> 08:54.080
<i>How rare! She showed her true 
nature in front of someone!</i>

08:54.080 --> 08:56.040
Amazing, isn't it?

08:56.040 --> 08:59.960
All the girls who come in 
here are overjoyed by it.

08:59.960 --> 09:03.870
A wedding dress isn't something you 
get to see very often, after all!

09:03.870 --> 09:05.420
Wedding?

09:05.420 --> 09:06.310
Oh, right.

09:06.310 --> 09:10.100
The pastor's church doesn't 
ever do weddings, does it?

09:10.100 --> 09:12.100
The opportunity hardly ever arises.

09:12.110 --> 09:17.060
The daughter of a good friend who lives 
far away is getting married soon,

09:17.060 --> 09:19.720
so my friend asked me to make the dress.

09:19.720 --> 09:24.740
I finished it a little sooner than planned, 
so I'm displaying it here for a little while.

09:24.740 --> 09:27.000
I see.

09:33.610 --> 09:35.980
To be able to wear something like this...

09:36.800 --> 09:39.610
she must be so very happy.

09:40.130 --> 09:42.840
Ugh, she's just so cute.

09:42.840 --> 09:44.930
I really wanted a daughter.

09:44.930 --> 09:46.890
Why are you looking at me?

09:46.890 --> 09:49.620
You don't have a daughter?

09:49.620 --> 09:52.150
All I have are sons.

09:52.150 --> 09:56.520
Which is why I just can't leave cute 
girls like you alone, Lady Saint.

09:56.520 --> 09:58.930
N-No, I'm really not at all...

09:58.930 --> 10:00.690
What are you talking about?

10:00.690 --> 10:03.990
Everyone in this village says 
that about you, you know?

10:03.990 --> 10:06.500
I-I don't know anything about that!

10:07.920 --> 10:10.310
I really wanted a daughter.

10:10.310 --> 10:13.000
So, why are you looking at me?

10:13.000 --> 10:15.000
Well, I guess that's enough for today.

10:15.000 --> 10:17.000
Lady Saint, here, take this.

10:17.000 --> 10:18.190
What?

10:18.190 --> 10:21.320
Since you came all the way here, 
take a piece of clothing with you.

10:21.320 --> 10:23.830
Oh, I couldn't. 
Just the thought is enough.

10:23.830 --> 10:25.470
What are you talking about?

10:25.470 --> 10:28.620
Lady Saint, you're always helping us out.

10:28.620 --> 10:30.900
Please accept things from us, too.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.400
Drip...

10:33.400 --> 10:37.370
Oh, my. I never imagined it 
would make you this happy.

10:37.370 --> 10:39.650
But, rather than 
a piece of clothing like that,

10:40.240 --> 10:44.040
I'll make a wedding dress 
for you any time, all right?

10:45.200 --> 10:48.050
L-Let's go, Lawren!

10:48.050 --> 10:50.120
Please don't dash outside like that!

10:50.120 --> 10:51.390
If you'll excuse us.

10:53.840 --> 10:56.130
Lady Saint, please wait!

10:56.130 --> 10:58.340
Are you feeling somehow unwell?

10:58.340 --> 11:01.240
N-No, I'm fine.

11:05.350 --> 11:09.100
Oh, look, Lawren! It's a cat!

11:16.280 --> 11:20.690
Just approaching an animal 
always makes them run away from me.

11:20.690 --> 11:23.960
Just once, I wish I could touch one.

11:24.600 --> 11:28.720
<i>I hope his wish will be granted one day.</i>

11:31.390 --> 11:33.290
Lady Saint, you go in first and—

11:33.290 --> 11:34.710
Please, wait!

11:35.950 --> 11:37.890
Lady Saint, whenever I come back,

11:37.890 --> 11:40.210
you always do that for me, don't you?

11:40.210 --> 11:41.380
What is it you're doing?

11:41.940 --> 11:44.120
You just have a little dust on you.

11:44.120 --> 11:46.140
Pastor!

11:47.570 --> 11:49.560
Flowers for the pastor!

11:49.560 --> 11:52.320
Oh, thank you so much!

11:54.280 --> 11:55.480
I'm so sorry.

11:55.480 --> 11:58.640
Lily insisted on coming to give you those.

11:58.640 --> 12:00.190
Not at all. It makes me quite happy.

12:00.190 --> 12:02.990
Oh, let me return the basket I borrowed.

12:02.990 --> 12:04.110
Please, come in.

12:04.110 --> 12:05.860
I'll look after little Lily.

12:05.860 --> 12:07.960
Will you? Thank you.

12:09.490 --> 12:10.860
What is it?

12:10.860 --> 12:17.270
Well, you know, when I get big, 
I'm gonna marry the pastor!

12:18.560 --> 12:19.640
No...

12:19.640 --> 12:21.320
No, you shouldn't do that.

12:21.320 --> 12:25.640
He does conduct himself very well, 
but he takes it all too far!

12:25.640 --> 12:28.770
He's strait-laced, exacting, 
obsessed with cleanliness,

12:28.770 --> 12:31.390
and really scary when he's angry!

12:31.390 --> 12:34.140
What ideas are you putting into her head?

12:34.830 --> 12:37.150
You're the saint.

12:37.150 --> 12:40.040
What are you doing speaking out 
about someone else's flaws?

12:40.040 --> 12:42.430
And to an innocent child at that?

12:42.430 --> 12:44.150
I'm sorry.

12:45.170 --> 12:49.660
But, as an agent of God, 
the saint cannot lie.

12:49.660 --> 12:53.240
If you were dissatisfied, 
you only needed to mention it to me.

12:55.960 --> 12:58.540
P-Please, wait!

12:58.540 --> 12:59.730
What are you—

12:59.730 --> 13:03.660
It's true, I can swear to God 
that I spoke not a single lie,

13:03.660 --> 13:06.260
b-but compared to everything I mentioned...

13:06.260 --> 13:10.180
there are so many more things 
I like about you, Lawren!

13:12.890 --> 13:15.880
So, would you like scones 
and black tea again today?

13:15.880 --> 13:17.660
Are you going to bake them for me?

13:17.660 --> 13:20.470
I will, so please let go of me.

13:30.850 --> 13:34.930
<i>The lady saint appeared in our 
village suddenly, out of nowhere.</i>

13:36.540 --> 13:39.380
<i>She was wandering the roadside, all alone,</i>

13:39.380 --> 13:42.700
<i>so I had her come to our little church.</i>

13:46.330 --> 13:51.300
<i>As the saint, I'm sure there must 
be more suitable places for her,</i>

13:51.300 --> 13:53.130
<i>but she ended up settling here.</i>

13:53.640 --> 13:56.270
<i>But, more than those 
complicated circumstances...</i>

13:59.950 --> 14:04.150
<i>I find that it's her, as a person, 
that I have to keep a watchful eye on.</i>

14:04.690 --> 14:06.630
Please, be careful.

14:06.630 --> 14:08.370
Sorry.

14:09.950 --> 14:12.950
Lawrence's scones are sublime

14:13.950 --> 14:16.960
I need to come up 
with some more variations...

14:17.530 --> 14:19.460
Lady Saint?

14:19.460 --> 14:21.200
It's morning!

14:21.200 --> 14:24.830
If you don't wake up soon, 
your breakfast is going to get cold!

14:25.140 --> 14:28.900
My consciousness is still hazy, 
so please come in and wake me.

14:28.900 --> 14:31.720
You seem to be answering 
clearly, though, aren't you?

14:31.720 --> 14:34.460
It's not possible. I can't wake up.

14:34.460 --> 14:36.780
Please come and wake me!

14:36.780 --> 14:38.500
Yes, all right.

14:38.500 --> 14:40.350
Then, I'm coming in!

14:44.060 --> 14:45.590
Look!

14:45.590 --> 14:47.840
These are the nightclothes 
I received yesterday!

14:47.840 --> 14:48.980
Really?

14:50.150 --> 14:51.480
What do you think?

14:51.480 --> 14:52.990
How adorable...

14:53.740 --> 14:54.960
those pajamas are.

14:55.240 --> 14:57.450
They're very well made.

14:57.450 --> 14:58.650
Lady Saint?

14:59.160 --> 15:02.260
I'm going to change, 
so please wait a moment.

15:02.260 --> 15:03.600
Yes, all right.

15:03.600 --> 15:05.490
Should I wait outside?

15:05.490 --> 15:06.300
What?

15:06.960 --> 15:11.210
<i>Lawren is going to be 
right outside while I change?</i>

15:11.450 --> 15:14.620
I think I'll go by myself after all, 
so you don't need to do that.

15:14.620 --> 15:16.080
What's wrong?

15:18.730 --> 15:21.120
We have a lot of vegetables today.

15:21.120 --> 15:24.450
They seemed like they might go
bad if we didn't have them soon.

15:26.220 --> 15:27.350
Now that I think about it,

15:27.350 --> 15:32.110
Lady Saint, you've never once 
mentioned a food you don't like.

15:32.110 --> 15:33.510
Of course not!

15:33.510 --> 15:37.740
A saint must show gratitude for all foods!

15:37.980 --> 15:42.040
You give off an aura indicating that you 
don't like green peppers and carrots, though.

15:42.040 --> 15:43.960
That is simply your own bias.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.880
I have no such dislikes.

15:45.880 --> 15:47.470
Since you bring it up, Lawren,

15:47.470 --> 15:49.600
you don't seem like you'd 
have such dislikes either.

15:49.600 --> 15:50.400
Huh?

15:53.880 --> 15:56.060
Of course I don't!

15:59.200 --> 16:04.020
A saint is someone 
who receives divine revelations.

16:04.020 --> 16:06.190
As such, they must not lie.

16:06.190 --> 16:09.430
And yet, though I do not lie,

16:09.430 --> 16:12.200
for you who are by my side to lie is...

16:12.200 --> 16:15.200
It seems a little unfair.

16:15.590 --> 16:17.850
I am in the wrong.

16:19.080 --> 16:22.720
The truth is, I can't eat shellfish.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.830
Shellfish?

16:23.830 --> 16:25.040
When I was little,

16:25.040 --> 16:28.250
we went to vacation on an island, 
and that's where I first ate shellfish.

16:28.250 --> 16:29.880
And then...

16:30.960 --> 16:32.630
It's so good!

16:32.630 --> 16:34.520
I could eat this forever!

16:35.580 --> 16:37.550
Is that so?

16:37.920 --> 16:40.130
I ate too much and made myself sick.

16:40.130 --> 16:42.130
I haven't been able to 
eat them at all since then.

16:42.130 --> 16:44.130
That's adorable!

16:44.130 --> 16:47.720
The reason behind it is a silly story, 
and it all makes me want to run and hide.

16:47.720 --> 16:50.060
So please, could you keep this a secret?

16:50.730 --> 16:53.930
<i>A secret of Lawren's that only I know!</i>

16:54.320 --> 16:55.670
I'll defend it with my life!

16:55.670 --> 16:57.750
You don't have to go quite that far!

16:57.750 --> 17:01.180
Now, once I've finished eating, 
I have to go do some shopping.

17:01.690 --> 17:03.310
I'll go, too!

17:08.100 --> 17:11.240
Lady Saint, it's dangerous 
to get distracted.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.800
What did I just say!

17:13.800 --> 17:15.380
Are you all right?

17:15.380 --> 17:17.270
You haven't hurt your foot, have you?

17:18.010 --> 17:19.230
Lady Saint?

17:19.230 --> 17:21.390
I-I'm fine!

17:22.120 --> 17:23.290
W-Wai—

17:23.290 --> 17:24.390
I'm so sorry, Lawren!

17:24.990 --> 17:26.590
You're not hurt, are you?

17:26.590 --> 17:28.820
What about you, Lady Saint, 
are you all right?

17:28.820 --> 17:31.610
Right now, I'm more worried 
about you being hurt, Lawren!

17:31.610 --> 17:33.400
No, Lady Saint, you're much more important.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.370
No, you are, Lawren.

17:35.370 --> 17:36.640
You are, Lady Saint.

17:36.640 --> 17:38.770
No, you are, Lawren!

17:36.640 --> 17:39.920
Those two get along so well, don't they?

17:54.850 --> 17:58.690
Let's see. The only things left 
that we need to buy are...

17:58.690 --> 18:00.840
ingredients for sweets,

18:00.840 --> 18:03.680
but we bought some sweets for you earlier,

18:03.680 --> 18:06.040
so maybe we don't need 
to buy as much this time.

18:06.620 --> 18:09.280
You wouldn't be able to eat all 
of it anyway, right, Lady Saint?

18:09.280 --> 18:11.920
Y-You could say I have 
a second stomach just for sweets!

18:11.920 --> 18:13.110
But...

18:13.110 --> 18:16.650
Please don't steal the fun from my life!

18:16.650 --> 18:18.950
You've suddenly raised 
the difficulty of the challenge here.

18:19.070 --> 18:20.320
Bought ingredients.

18:20.660 --> 18:24.010
There are other things to look 
forward to in life, aren't there?

18:24.010 --> 18:26.080
Of course there are!

18:26.080 --> 18:26.830
Right?

18:27.050 --> 18:28.330
Then, why did...

18:29.960 --> 18:33.960
For example, the food Lawren makes me...

18:34.680 --> 18:37.880
or gazing at the flowers that Lawren grew...

18:38.440 --> 18:41.970
or when Lawren comes 
and wakes me up in the morning...

18:42.440 --> 18:45.120
I can't lose a single one of them!

18:45.470 --> 18:47.250
Lady Saint...

18:47.720 --> 18:50.650
Couldn't you have simply 
said "household chores"?

18:59.660 --> 19:01.730
This rain really started 
coming down out of nowhere.

19:01.730 --> 19:03.570
Lady Saint, are you all right?

19:03.570 --> 19:05.360
It's so heavy.

19:05.360 --> 19:07.290
The frills have harmful side effects!

19:09.040 --> 19:11.420
But, Lawren, are you all right?

19:11.420 --> 19:15.420
You have it much worse 
than I do, Lady Saint.

19:15.420 --> 19:17.160
This is bad.

19:17.160 --> 19:20.230
If we wait until the rain lets up, 
the lady saint might catch a cold.

19:20.230 --> 19:22.040
Pastor! Lady Saint!

19:22.040 --> 19:24.170
You don't have umbrellas?

19:24.170 --> 19:25.060
We don't.

19:25.060 --> 19:27.180
I didn't think it was going to rain.

19:27.180 --> 19:30.630
You'll catch a cold! Please use my umbrella!

19:30.630 --> 19:32.350
What? But...

19:32.350 --> 19:33.720
It's all right.

19:33.720 --> 19:35.720
I'll have him share his umbrella with me.

19:35.720 --> 19:36.680
Bye!

19:39.730 --> 19:41.280
I'm very grateful to them.

19:41.280 --> 19:43.700
Now, Lady Saint, you should use it.

19:43.700 --> 19:44.740
What?

19:44.740 --> 19:46.600
Don't worry about me. I'm fine.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.500
Please, go ahead.

19:50.750 --> 19:54.990
Lawren, you'll catch a cold, 
so let's use it together!

19:54.990 --> 19:56.630
You're being very assertive!

19:56.630 --> 19:58.760
But our heights are too different.

19:58.760 --> 20:01.390
You'll get wet, Lady Saint.

20:01.390 --> 20:03.880
Could we take this in the direction of,

20:03.880 --> 20:06.030
"A saint even looks good soaking wet"?

20:06.030 --> 20:07.680
Do you want to get drenched?

20:07.680 --> 20:09.390
If I wear my head covering,

20:09.390 --> 20:12.490
I'll be able to keep the rain 
from the sides off of me!

20:13.480 --> 20:16.610
If you insist that much, then all right.

20:16.610 --> 20:19.790
But if you start getting wet, Lady Saint,

20:19.790 --> 20:21.540
then I'm going to force you
to take this umbrella.

20:21.540 --> 20:23.360
A-All right!

20:32.650 --> 20:35.220
Oh, it stopped.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.900
How...

20:37.900 --> 20:41.110
How could the weather be so untimely?

20:41.480 --> 20:43.040
Lady Saint!

20:43.040 --> 20:44.940
A-Are you all right?

20:44.940 --> 20:45.880
Yes.

20:45.880 --> 20:48.480
And it doesn't much matter if I get wet now.

20:48.770 --> 20:50.210
No! Please excuse my impertinence.

20:51.220 --> 20:52.840
L-L-L-Lawren?!

20:52.840 --> 20:54.160
I'm sorry.

20:54.160 --> 20:56.250
Please endure it for just a little while.

20:57.240 --> 21:00.490
You mustn't catch a cold. 
We're going to hurry home.

21:00.490 --> 21:04.260
I'd prefer to go slowly like this.

21:04.260 --> 21:06.720
I just said, you're going to catch a cold!

21:10.640 --> 21:12.530
Lawren, you should have a bath, too.

21:16.220 --> 21:19.190
<i>It's unusual for him 
to fall asleep like this.</i>

21:19.190 --> 21:21.500
<i>Lawren in a completely unguarded moment.</i>

21:32.790 --> 21:38.690
<i>As the saint, I have a duty 
to protect the people of this village.</i>

21:39.380 --> 21:40.860
<i>But, Lawren...</i>

21:41.430 --> 21:45.570
<i>I'm with you completely 
due to my own selfishness.</i>

21:46.490 --> 21:49.970
<i>I will protect you forever.</i>

23:21.960 --> 23:25.690
The lady saint is lazing around!

23:21.970 --> 23:24.150
Droop...

23:26.640 --> 23:28.770
Droop...

23:26.650 --> 23:29.440
The lady saint is lazing around!

23:29.840 --> 23:32.050
The lady saint is lazing around!

23:29.840 --> 23:32.050
Droop...

23:36.400 --> 23:38.280
I can't do it anymore!
